  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Helmsley Charitable Trust (HCT) Matembe Cooperative Livelihood Improvement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It is expected that after investing in the cooperative, the farmers will increase their production of both livestock and crops and therefore get more incomes from their sales. This will then lead to improved livelihoods.</narrative>
